WEBVTT

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:38.430
TAVERN NOMAZUKUWAZU

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:41.930
WILL OPEN SHORTLY

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:51.160
So how long can you work?

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.240
Well... About one week.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:56.910
One week?

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:59.110
Yes. College classes start...

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.350
I can work more than a month.

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.320
Thank you very much!

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.500
You're such an idiot!

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.720
You're lucky he hired you...

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:26.810
but you gotta say
you can stay longer.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.440
But what about
when I have to quit?

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.750
That's another story.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.440
You gotta quit, you quit.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:37.850
I guess.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.190
From the very beginning...

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.260
I wasn't really into
this part-time job.

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:04.850
Oh!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:06.620
Hey!

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.280
H-Hello!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.350
Here for a visit?

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.290
Y-Yes.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:15.220
Godai and I decided to take
a part-time job...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.910
at a tavern near here.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.950
Really? When do you start?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.090
Tomorrow.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:22.450
So I'll be staying
with Godai for a week.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:25.100
I see. Sounds tough.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:26.070
Oh, no.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.700
Is that your dinner?

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:30.420
Yes.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.730
You're sure buying a lot.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.040
Well, they're for the whole week.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:40.720
You're going to eat
those all week?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:44.120
We plan to eat out a few times.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.470
I-I see.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:49.440
Manager! Thanks for waiting.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.320
Hey, it's you!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.190
Hi.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:56.530
He's staying with Godai.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:03:59.340
Well, see you.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:00.030
Yup.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:04.310
What were you two talking about?

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:05.890
Well...

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.100
WHAT? At a tavern?!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:17.420
Hey, Sakamoto!
Want potstickers?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.580
They're on sale today.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.360
Hey! Potstickers?!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.150
Sakamoto?

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.320
Didja hear me?

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.070
You!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.320
W-What?

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.430
I was feeling great
'til you interrupted.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.340
Huh?

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.260
What?

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:47.420
I just saw the manager!

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:48.510
What?!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.010
Why didn't you call me?!

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.210
Why should I?
You only live with her.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.130
I-I guess, but...

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.820
You're so lucky a woman
like that is always around.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.740
She's around, all right, but...

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.000
Lucky dog...

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.030
It's really hard for me,
you know.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.260
Like a dog with food in its bowl
that it can't have?

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:11.830
Yeah.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.010
What? You're calling her dog food?!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:18.940
How dare you!

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.140
All right! Okay!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.620
We're back!

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.860
She's not gonna come out, idiot.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:32.880
Hello!

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.000
It was nice seeing you earlier.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:38.060
-You took your time, didn't you?
-Yes.

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.530
Do you like curry?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:45.030
Please join me for dinner.
I made too much.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.010
Ooh! Really?!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.610
Godai, you too.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:50.700
All right.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.400
See you in 30 minutes.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.110
Yes! Lookin' forward to it!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.770
Thanks!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.420
Scored, huh?!

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.190
What's the matter?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:04.560
"Godai', you too"?

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:06.510
"You TOO"?

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.120
It's great!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:22.640
Delicious!

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.110
Not too spicy?

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.810
Not at all.  It's the best!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:28.710
Right, Godai?

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:31.450
Yeah.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:34.950
Maybe I'll board here, too.
Just kidding!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.150
If I had a wife like you,
I'd die happy.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:39.000
Oh, please.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:45.630
Any man would think so,
right, Godai?

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.110
Oh, yeah, Manager,
do you drink?

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.610
Me? A little.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.750
Well, then please
drop by our workplace.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.440
Manager!  It'll be my treat!

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:00.700
As a thanks for tonight.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.190
You don't have to do that.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.420
Yeah. I'm the one...

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.550
I INSIST!

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:08.490
We've been good friends.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:09.620
But...

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.740
It's only right that
I do something for you...

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.630
in return for your
kindness to my friend.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.960
Well, all right. I'll come.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:20.530
That's a promise.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.830
I'll treat.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:25.070
NO!  It will be on ME!

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:36.940
You know...

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.130
you make it so obvious
you want her all to yourself.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.130
What's it to you?

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:43.560
You're the one
going gaga over her.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.590
I just have an innocent
crush on her.  That's all.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.130
Liar.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.130
Don't you know how to admire
a beautiful flower?

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.630
Godai is frustrated!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.390
Long time no see.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.170
Hi.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:59.510
Enjoying a round of drinks, I see.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.510
There's nothing
for you, Yotsuya.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.550
No?

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.830
No.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.320
Really?

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:07.620
Really.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:18.690
Hey! You're here.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:19.490
Hi.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.190
Great. Another busybody.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.130
How've you been, Sakamoto?

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.760
Just fine!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:26.880
Just one sip.

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:35.510
Deeelish!

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.490
No fair!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.270
Hey! That's my...

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.620
Isn't it terrible?

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:45.490
Godai is only nice
to half-naked women.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:54.600
All gone.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:55.860
Thanks.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.460
Are you busy
at work, Akemi?

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:02.240
Not really.
Got a day off tomorrow.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:05.390
Is that so? Me too.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.630
Good for you.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.380
Indeed, it is.

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:10.510
See ya.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:11.750
Well, then.

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:13.080
'Night.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.420
What was that?

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.880
I have a bad, bad feeling.

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:34.370
Grilled chicken skewers
for Table 3.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.880
Ordering! One stew.
Five hot sake.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.170
Good evening!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.980
Show the party of four
to Table 8, please.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.580
Boiled tofu for Table 4, ready.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.850
Ordering!
Two puffer fish rice gruel.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.770
Hey! You forgot
the beer for Table 5.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.180
Oh yeah!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.880
-Pay attention.
-Sorry.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:56.630
-Uncap it!
-Yes!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.490
-Mark it on their check!
-Yes.

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.150
Good evening!

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.520
There's a table in the back!

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.370
Welcome.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:09.880
Good evening.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:12.110
Manager!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.110
Please.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.450
Welcome.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.770
Godai!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.850
Oops!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:23.630
When you're done, take out the
empties next to the cash register.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:24.710
Yes!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.280
Have a seat, Manager.

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:29.830
Thank you.

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:37.780
Hey! Where's our beer?

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.660
Yes! Coming!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.930
How about some beer?

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:45.600
S-Sure. Thank you.
I know you're busy.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.250
Not at all. Stay and relax.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.580
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.740
-Ordering! One dried cuttlefish.
-'Kay!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.910
Here you go.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.450
Let me!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.640
-GODAI!
-Yes!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:03.360
Take the empties OUT!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.310
Yes!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:06.890
Shoot!

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:22.010
Here we are.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.110
-Boo!
-You look great in that.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:29.670
I knew...

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.220
they'd come.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.320
For Table 10.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:50.610
Godai.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:52.390
-Huh?
-Wake up!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.210
Take these to Table 10.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:05.300
You can't stand poverty
unless you're drunk.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.100
Here you go!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.700
Here. Your chicken skewers.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.250
Hey, you working student!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.680
Nice little place.
I like it.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.330
How about a drink?

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:17.890
Listen you...!

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:19.050
Stop it!

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:23.500
Godai's working here.
Please don't cause trouble.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:27.450
Hey! We're not makin' trouble, right?

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.000
No way.  He's treating us,
after all.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.630
Thanks for extending
your generosity to us, too.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:38.820
Hey! Who told you
I'm treating you all?

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:41.940
Don't pretend
you don't remember.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:45.430
We're so fortunate to have
such a great neighbor.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.680
He's not just a neighbor.
He's practically family.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.150
Yeah. He's like our
generous little brother.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.890
Hello. Stay as long as you want.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.020
You bet we will!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:12:59.820
The boss's asking for you.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:09.560
We're insanely busy.
You can't stop and chat.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.940
You're not a host. Get it?!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:13.910
I'm sorry.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:23.050
Please stop.
It's Godai's first night here.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.580
Oh, yeah!

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.770
Who're they? You know them?

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.170
Huh? N-Never seen them.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.930
Godai! More beer!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.410
She just called your name.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:56.390
Th-This. She must have
seen my name tag.

00:13:56.530 --> 00:14:01.710
Yusaku! Watcha doin'?
More beer!

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:05.030
Y-Yes! Right away!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.830
Be quiet!

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.170
Oh, c'mon. Loosen up.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.190
You're embarrassing the manager.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.260
Whaddaya mean?

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:18.540
She's all red.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.880
She's drunk.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.570
I'm embarrassed!

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.000
That's 'cause you're
not drunk enough.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:27.470
Drink up.

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:29.380
I've had quite...

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.650
C'mon. You can drink more.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.080
Yeah! Bottoms up!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.590
Down it! Down it!

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:41.560
Down it! Down it!

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:43.460
Down it! Down it!

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.330
YEAH!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.360
Have another.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:52.200
Please! I'm done.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.400
C'mon!

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:56.090
Manager.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.380
Godai!

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.730
YES!!

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:08.810
Look here! What's this chicken order
for Table 9?

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:10.180
Huh?

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:12.290
Teriyaki sauce or salted?

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:13.560
I'll go find out.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:15.630
Don't go empty-handed.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.950
Take this to #9.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.800
You still drinkin', Manager?

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:23.560
Yes.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.310
H-Hot!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.280
Hot!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:32.310
What's this?
We didn't order this.

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:34.420
I-It's really hot. I'm sorry.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:36.930
That idiot!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:40.280
I'll take it away
in just a second.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:43.050
Godai, please use this.

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:45.900
Manager.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:49.710
Thank you.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:57.190
I'm sorry. He's new.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.670
It's okay, Godai! Chin up!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.930
-Stop! Please!
-Go, go, Godai!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.280
Please!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.830
Go, go, Godai!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:10.060
Go, go, Godai!
Go, go, Godai!

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.150
I was afraid this would happen.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.390
I knew it would.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:19.060
Thank you!

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.880
My premonition last night
was right on.

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:52.720
Godai?

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:54.950
Manager.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.770
You're working hard.

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.360
I'm just not used to it yet.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.200
Are you leaving now?

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:06.810
No, I thought
I'd get some fresh air.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:11.060
Are they forcing you to drink?

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:12.750
I'm fine.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.950
You should leave them
and go home.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.580
I know they're persistent.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.850
Absolutely not.
I can't go home.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:20.880
Whaa--?

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.720
Godai! Get back to work!

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.800
Sorry.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:29.320
Table 10.
Five hot sake. Hurry.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.240
Sorry!

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:35.400
I can't go home.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.060
If I don't keep them under control...

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.440
they'll...

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:48.140
My lover is
the chief's daughter

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:53.780
Herskin is dark

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.460
But she's an exotic
island beauty

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.820
I can't keep them under control.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.440
Manager, you look out of it.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.100
Uh... Akemi?

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:16.130
This is great.
Have some.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.040
Um...

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.690
And then the guy says to me...

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:23.080
"Would you like to go out
to dinner with me after work?"

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:26.110
Not a face you wanna
look at through a meal!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.120
Everyone!

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:31.730
Why don't we start heading home?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:32.820
What?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.150
Go home?

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.220
Why?

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:41.770
We've had quite enough, and
we're burdening Godai at work.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:46.170
That's odd.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.540
No one's burdening him.

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:49.510
That's right.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.990
We're HELPING his workplace
with increased sales.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.750
Right?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.190
"Helping"?

00:18:58.230 --> 00:18:59.990
What d'ya think you're doing?!

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.080
I'm sorry!
My hand slipped.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:04.560
I'm really very
sorry about this.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:07.090
I'll take care of this.
GO GET THE PHONE!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.000
Yes!

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:11.000
-Take it like a man, Yusaku!
-Don't let it get you down!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.760
Go, go, Godai!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.060
Hello. Nomazukuwazu.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.060
...Go, Godai!
Go, go, Godai!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.560
What? What is the
customer's name?

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.010
Go Godai!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.810
What? I'm sorry.
I can't hear you.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.070
Godai!

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:47.890
Godai...

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:48.560
Yes?

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:51.940
Time for last orders.
Go ask Table 10.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:54.560
Yes!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.450
Last...order?

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:01.980
Yes.  It's 30 minutes
before closing.

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:04.460
We've had enough. Let's...

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.720
I want five hot sake!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:06.880
Sake with a splash for me!

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:08.290
Whole grilled squid.
Fried chicken.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:10.300
Dried cuttlefish.  Fish liver.
Gizzards.

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:13.560
Vinegared crab. Mozuku seaweed.
And five rice balls to go.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.690
Great idea!!

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.760
Manager, are you all right?

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.920
Never mind me.
What are YOU going to do?

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.010
What do you mean?

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:25.300
The bill.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.040
The bill.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:31.370
What did you say?
I can't hear you.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.520
Come with me.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:38.600
Can you walk?

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:41.290
I'm fine. Just come.

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:48.730
-Sakamoto, turn off the store sign.
-Yes.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:53.540
My thirst for free liquor
is unquenchable!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.470
Bottomless!

00:20:56.670 --> 00:21:01.700
See? They really think
this is ALL on you.

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:03.980
It seems that way.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:07.130
What do you mean,
"it seems that way"?

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.870
Don't you get it yet?

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.980
They step all over you 'cause
you don't stand up for yourself.

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:19.060
I'll take care
of tonight's bill.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.650
What? N-No, you can't do that.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:23.380
You have to make them
pay their share.

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:26.920
You know they'll
never go for that!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:27.770
But...

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:31.010
Leave everything to
your big sister here.

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:32.210
"Big sister"?

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:34.170
Yup.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.110
Manager.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.520
I think maybe you're drunk.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.110
I can handle it!

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:52.500
M-Manager!

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:55.660
Are you all right?
Manager?

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:57.200
Manager!

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:12.400
The drinks were great tonight!

00:22:12.490 --> 00:22:14.010
I feel a little tipsy.

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:20.640
A chilly winternight
The drinks never ceased
And the food was free, too

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:25.120
Godai! Want me to carry her?

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:26.470
I'm fine.

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:30.260
She's the manager
of my building.

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:33.010
But you're gonna be really beat.

00:22:33.070 --> 00:22:35.810
You just mind your own business.
Let's go. C'mon.

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:37.940
Let's go home
and drink some more.

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:52.520
She's my manager.

00:22:54.590 --> 00:22:56.820
Godai? What about the bill?

00:22:57.120 --> 00:22:59.690
Don't worry. I took care of it.

00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:04.440
HEY!

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:06.530
W-What?

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:10.000
I TOLE YA, LEAVE IT
T'YA BIG SISTHER!

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:13.000
M-Manager! I can't breathe!

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:16.040
Whatcha doin'?

00:23:16.110 --> 00:23:18.520
Drunk.
What a pathetic sight.

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:21.720
Don't drink and drive.
Don't drive when drunk.

00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:25.220
C-Can't breathe! L-Let go!

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:30.730
You're such a smart aleck!

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:35.660
I TOLE YA T'LEAVE IT T'ME!

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:38.770
Stop actin' so cool!

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.180
The manager? She went
to her parents' place.

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.710
Her mom's got a real bad cold.

00:23:54.890 --> 00:23:58.150
Maybe it's another ploy to get
her married off somewhere.

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:02.650
Next: "Godai's Revelation!
Can't You TRY and Understand?!"

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:06.510
I don't have a girlfriend,
but I am in love with someone.
